+Seed & Raw & Average & Raw & Average \\
+\midrule
+$0$ & $95.49$ & $100.00$ & $31.87$ & $30.46$ \\
+$1$ & $94.14$ & $100.00$ & $9.09$ & $0.93$ \\
+$2$ & $99.99$ & $100.00$ & $0.93$ & $0.88$ \\
+$3$ & $89.54$ & $99.12$ & $53.60$ & $65.29$ \\
